      Have a product to shape, a problem to untangle,
      <br />
      or an idea you’d like to build together?
    </p>
    <a class="contact-email" href="mailto:john@basham.au">
      john@basham.au ↗
    </a>
    <p class="muted">
      Based in the Nambucca Valley, Australia.
      <br />
      Experienced in working remotely and asynchronously.
    </p>
